(7406801, 1166889, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Props for trying something a bit different!  Some might say the space at the top is wasted, but I think it works well the way it''s composed.</td>', 'Ha!  Props for trying something a bit different!  Some might say the space at the top is wasted, but I think it works well the way it''s composed.', '2015-09-30 00:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7406802, 1166947, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute little egg topper thingie, though I have no idea why you need an egg topper.  Is it to keep it warm?</td>', 'Cute little egg topper thingie, though I have no idea why you need an egg topper.  Is it to keep it warm?', '2015-09-30 00:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7406803, 1166858, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I like.</td>', 'Ha!  I like.', '2015-09-30 00:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7406804, 1166937, 30982, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far...</td>', 'My favorite so far...', '2015-09-30 00:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7406805, 1166955, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pretty much an antithesis of a "still" life, in that it''s all moving, but it makes for a nice still life just the same!</td>', 'Pretty much an antithesis of a "still" life, in that it''s all moving, but it makes for a nice still life just the same!', '2015-09-30 00:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407174, 1166955, 173844, '<td valign="top">Even though not to my understanding of a still life, the wonder of this image has, in my opinion, launched it past such stricture with its keen appreciation of the surreal.  The succinct yet resonant title is perfect.  The patch of scenery extracted from darkness is a world apart, but with the sense of continuity implied by the streaking lines of light.  The blood moon darts about like a loosed balloon.  And a person walks distantly into the scenery.  The colors are gorgeous.  I''m transported.  My personal favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'Even though not to my understanding of a still life, the wonder of this image has, in my opinion, launched it past such stricture with its keen appreciation of the surreal.  The succinct yet resonant title is perfect.  The patch of scenery extracted from darkness is a world apart, but with the sense of continuity implied by the streaking lines of light.  The blood moon darts about like a loosed balloon.  And a person walks distantly into the scenery.  The colors are gorgeous.  I''m transported.  My personal favorite in this challenge.', '2015-10-01 12:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407202, 1166934, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love this image for many reasons.  Though obviously a car dashboard, it''s reinvigorated from the mundane by holding it up for close attention.  The knobs have come alive in gleaming contrast to the dark, muddied background, so deliciously and murkily processed.  The surrealism, in my opinion, is engendered by the sense of hovering about the inanimate and the sense of imminent ignition, roaring to life.  And it''s just so impressive how very much the photographer can glean from what is easily passed by as too familiar to be worthy of note.  Inspirational.</td>', 'I love this image for many reasons.  Though obviously a car dashboard, it''s reinvigorated from the mundane by holding it up for close attention.  The knobs have come alive in gleaming contrast to the dark, muddied background, so deliciously and murkily processed.  The surrealism, in my opinion, is engendered by the sense of hovering about the inanimate and the sense of imminent ignition, roaring to life.  And it''s just so impressive how very much the photographer can glean from what is easily passed by as too familiar to be worthy of note.  Inspirational.', '2015-10-01 12:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407212, 1166950, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really fine counter-intuitive surrealistic shock.  Ice coffee.  The background is nicely harmonious.  Good title.</td>', 'Really fine counter-intuitive surrealistic shock.  Ice coffee.  The background is nicely harmonious.  Good title.', '2015-10-01 13:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407216, 1166961, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsomely put together and visually surprising.  Unlike many entries that merely grouped disparate objects together, you''ve offered an entirety, a story that relates the objects and is jarringly quirky.  The bright red-orange of the tentacles is the perfect note to bring it all together.</td>', 'Handsomely put together and visually surprising.  Unlike many entries that merely grouped disparate objects together, you''ve offered an entirety, a story that relates the objects and is jarringly quirky.  The bright red-orange of the tentacles is the perfect note to bring it all together.', '2015-10-01 13:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407239, 1166956, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh!  COOL!!</td>', 'Oh!  COOL!!', '2015-10-01 17:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407240, 1166860, 86447, '<td valign="top">Definitely surreal</td>', 'Definitely surreal', '2015-10-01 17:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407241, 1166850, 86447, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  It fits the challenge perfectly.<br/> <br/>I''m torn about the processing, though.</td>', 'Interesting.  It fits the challenge perfectly. I''m torn about the processing, though.', '2015-10-01 17:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407242, 1166961, 86447, '<td valign="top">oooohhhhh!  I want some dry ice!   This is cool!</td>', 'oooohhhhh!  I want some dry ice!   This is cool!', '2015-10-01 17:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407243, 1166902, 86447, '<td valign="top">This definitely fits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'This definitely fits the challenge perfectly.', '2015-10-01 18:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407244, 1166858, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge topic perfectly.   Totally surreal.</td>', 'Fits the challenge topic perfectly.   Totally surreal.', '2015-10-01 18:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407245, 1166814, 86447, '<td valign="top">Way cool!   Way Surreal!  :D<br/> <br/>My favorite of them all.  well done!</td>', 'Way cool!   Way Surreal!  :D My favorite of them all.  well done!', '2015-10-01 18:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407534, 1166889, 61396, '<td valign="top">beautiful model</td>', 'beautiful model', '2015-10-02 15:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407547, 1166781, 50695, '<td valign="top">good job creating a Salvador Dali feel</td>', 'good job creating a Salvador Dali feel', '2015-10-02 18:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407549, 1166919, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fabulously suggestive. Embryonic Moby Dick?  Nematode?  Orchid?  One is thrust beyond the clutch of rationality into the availing arms of the surreal.  It''s suffused with mysterious imminence.  Wonderful selection.</td>', 'Fabulously suggestive. Embryonic Moby Dick?  Nematode?  Orchid?  One is thrust beyond the clutch of rationality into the availing arms of the surreal.  It''s suffused with mysterious imminence.  Wonderful selection.', '2015-10-02 18:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407550, 1166937, 173844, '<td valign="top">Can''t go wrong here with dead fish plying the surface world, but it shows great imagination to arrange them so artfully.  The "magnetic fields" add that touch of mystery and whimsy within which surrealism thrives.  Furthermore, the play of light and dark is reminiscent of the watery realms once again.  Very nice.</td>', 'Can''t go wrong here with dead fish plying the surface world, but it shows great imagination to arrange them so artfully.  The "magnetic fields" add that touch of mystery and whimsy within which surrealism thrives.  Furthermore, the play of light and dark is reminiscent of the watery realms once again.  Very nice.', '2015-10-02 18:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407551, 1166930, 173844, '<td valign="top">Color and form massed into a surreal marvel of abundance.</td>', 'Color and form massed into a surreal marvel of abundance.', '2015-10-02 18:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407552, 1166900, 173844, '<td valign="top">Surreal sci-fi.  Makes me jumpy, ergo successful.</td>', 'Surreal sci-fi.  Makes me jumpy, ergo successful.', '2015-10-02 18:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407554, 1166895, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine, clean juxtaposition.</td>', 'Fine, clean juxtaposition.', '2015-10-02 18:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407555, 1166800, 173844, '<td valign="top">Straightforward and thought-provoking.</td>', 'Straightforward and thought-provoking.', '2015-10-02 18:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407633, 1166912, 173844, '<td valign="top">Can''t explain why this image strikes me a surreal, but it does.  There is no shock of dissonance or confounding juxtaposition.  Maybe it''s the tipped over leaves that seem like people, animals, aliens.  Maybe it''s the persistent sameness of color, or being smack dab in the midst of the crowd.  However, I''m impressed by the inventive vision of the photographer.</td>', 'Can''t explain why this image strikes me a surreal, but it does.  There is no shock of dissonance or confounding juxtaposition.  Maybe it''s the tipped over leaves that seem like people, animals, aliens.  Maybe it''s the persistent sameness of color, or being smack dab in the midst of the crowd.  However, I''m impressed by the inventive vision of the photographer.', '2015-10-03 14:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407635, 1166937, 61396, '<td valign="top">the reflective layer elevates an already mysterious constellation to a new level (maybe that''s a surrealistic level?)</td>', 'the reflective layer elevates an already mysterious constellation to a new level (maybe that''s a surrealistic level?)', '2015-10-03 15:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407636, 1166955, 61396, '<td valign="top">nicely painted</td>', 'nicely painted', '2015-10-03 15:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407637, 1166956, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well-done image of a plummeting or lifting free of gravity -- can we tell? -- tea time.  A tour de force.  Where has Mary Poppins been all these years?  Additionally, I love the distortion of the base of the bottle vase.</td>', 'Well-done image of a plummeting or lifting free of gravity -- can we tell? -- tea time.  A tour de force.  Where has Mary Poppins been all these years?  Additionally, I love the distortion of the base of the bottle vase.', '2015-10-03 15:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407638, 1166858, 173844, '<td valign="top">A la Magritte, but beautifully expressed in its own right.  The shock of juxtaposition and shattering limbs is classic surrealism.  I love the colors, with the contrasting onion as exclamation point.  She has a lot to cry about.</td>', 'A la Magritte, but beautifully expressed in its own right.  The shock of juxtaposition and shattering limbs is classic surrealism.  I love the colors, with the contrasting onion as exclamation point.  She has a lot to cry about.', '2015-10-03 15:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407639, 1166858, 61396, '<td valign="top">a reference to Magritte''s "Son of Man" takes a rough turn with the red stains on the figure dress resembling blood.</td>', 'a reference to Magritte''s "Son of Man" takes a rough turn with the red stains on the figure dress resembling blood.', '2015-10-03 15:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407640, 1166901, 173844, '<td valign="top">Soft-core surrealism --  just a touch of strangeness.  The inanimate foot gently tapping to the music is subtle and engaging.</td>', 'Soft-core surrealism --  just a touch of strangeness.  The inanimate foot gently tapping to the music is subtle and engaging.', '2015-10-03 15:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407641, 1166838, 173844, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion, these disparate objects could be fancifully integrated to better achieve that surprise that inspires the sense of the surreal.</td>', 'In my humble opinion, these disparate objects could be fancifully integrated to better achieve that surprise that inspires the sense of the surreal.', '2015-10-03 15:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407642, 1166779, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice mixture of sci-fi and surreal.  I like the lighting.</td>', 'Nice mixture of sci-fi and surreal.  I like the lighting.', '2015-10-03 15:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407643, 1166856, 173844, '<td valign="top">Clever effect.  Great neon blue lines.</td>', 'Clever effect.  Great neon blue lines.', '2015-10-03 15:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7407644, 1166746, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good idea.</td>', 'Good idea.', '2015-10-03 15:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
