(7407787, 1166909, 173844, '<td valign="top">Surreal in giving the everyday its comeuppance.  I''m appreciating this image more on the second go-round because it''s so interesting how the swan-like neck and made up head uncoil out of the shawl --  cobra, will-o-the-wisp, ascending angel?  And what''s the hair dryer for, or has it already served its purpose?  Questions proliferate.  Very nice.</td>', 'Surreal in giving the everyday its comeuppance.  I''m appreciating this image more on the second go-round because it''s so interesting how the swan-like neck and made up head uncoil out of the shawl --  cobra, will-o-the-wisp, ascending angel?  And what''s the hair dryer for, or has it already served its purpose?  Questions proliferate.  Very nice.', '2015-10-04 16:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
