(7407848, 1166644, 173844, '<td valign="top">These dead trees could certainly be imagined into life in accordance with their grotesque postures, giving this handsome black and white scene a boost of surrealism.  I especially like the depth of field with its receding planes.  I''m confused about the word "vlei."  Googling it offers a meaning of a shallow, minor and often transient pond or marsh.  Maybe I''m missing something.</td>', 'These dead trees could certainly be imagined into life in accordance with their grotesque postures, giving this handsome black and white scene a boost of surrealism.  I especially like the depth of field with its receding planes.  I''m confused about the word "vlei."  Googling it offers a meaning of a shallow, minor and often transient pond or marsh.  Maybe I''m missing something.', '2015-10-04 19:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
