(7408157, 1166956, 7810, '<td valign="top">Ha !!!<br/>Just read your photo description. (Big Smile) Thanks for the shout out and thanks for checking my profile. <br/>Your photo turned out wonderful. The bit of tea in the cup was an excellent touch and yes things hanging on fishing lines can be very frustrating. <br/>You should try this type of set-up outside, now there is a challenge :D<br/>Congrats on the star shot HM well done!!!</td>', 'Ha !!!Just read your photo description. (Big Smile) Thanks for the shout out and thanks for checking my profile. Your photo turned out wonderful. The bit of tea in the cup was an excellent touch and yes things hanging on fishing lines can be very frustrating. You should try this type of set-up outside, now there is a challenge :DCongrats on the star shot HM well done!!!', '2015-10-05 19:55:26.000000', NULL, 0),
